        "text": "Digital identity is another sector that can benefit from the properties of NFTs. Storing identification and ownership data on the blockchain would increase privacy and data integrity because blockchains are more secure than centralized databases. NFT virtual land on Metaverse platforms is another promising use case. NFTs are perfect for representing virtual land ownership. Because each piece of land is unique. Landowners can use their plots to do many things, including hosting online events, displaying content, and advertising. Virtual land will likely continue to progress as we move closer to a metaverse future.",
